{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":340,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":340,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我和其他荒野客不一样？哦，你是指我安置逝者的事吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我自己也觉得很奇怪，看到有人在荒野不幸罹难的话，我心里会有种——不知道该怎么形容，总之就是乱糟糟的感觉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那种感觉就像是什么事做了一半没有完成，在做别的事的时候脑子里总是会分心，你能理解吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]逝去的生命果然要入土为安才算是真正结束，而工具啊物资之类，应该由活着的人，为了更好地活下去而使用。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这样才合理，对吧？所以我在拾荒的时候，总是会先将遗体安置好之后，再取用他们剩下来的物资。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这算是一种善良？又或者是一种怜悯？还是物尽其用的理智？这个我也不太清楚啦……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"米托拉-亲密1","script":"yd_002_07"}